{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32692","headline":"黄雀行 · 李频","name":"黄雀行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲窃高仓集御河，翩翩疑渡畏秋波。\n朱宫晚树侵莺语，画阁香帘夺燕窠。\n疎影暗栖寒露重，空城饥噪暮烟多。\n谁令不解高飞去，破宅荒庭有网罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}